# CCVAA Web — no environment variables required.
#
# The site is a static export (`output: "export"`) hosted on GitHub Pages.
# There is no server runtime, no database, and no secrets.
#
# `npm run dev` and `npm run build` work with an empty environment.
#
# See specs/platform-0002-github-pages-static-migration.md for what was removed
# and why (members portal, admin console, Stripe, Neon, Resend, Edge Config).
